# Network shares (for example the family NAS or a shared folder on a
# Windows PC) pinned in the Files sidebar for every person.
#
# One share per line: the address, then an optional name for the sidebar.
# Windows-style paths and smb:// addresses both work:
#   \\family-pc\Photos           Family Photos
#   smb://nas.local/Media         Media
# Each user's first connection asks for their Windows/NAS user name and
# password; choosing "Remember forever" saves it in their keyring.
# Lines are added at every login, so new entries reach existing users;
# removing a line here does not remove the bookmark from users who have it.
